WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.367 --> 00:00:02.334
-Guys, it is Tuesday.
It's time for "WeTweet."

00:00:02.334 --> 00:00:03.767
Here we go.

00:00:03.767 --> 00:00:07.133
