you like each one.

00:00:20.067 --> 00:00:21.767
You all have voting clickers
at your seats.

00:00:21.767 --> 00:00:24.334
You see them there?
You can vote for all of them.

00:00:24.334 --> 00:00:26.200
You can vote for none of them.
Whatever you want.

00:00:26.200 --> 00:00:27.601
We'll see the results live.

00:00:27.601 --> 00:00:29.200
Higgins, Roots, you all have
your clickers too?

00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:30.801
-Ready.
-Alright, we're going to see

00:00:30.801 --> 00:00:32.834
which one gets the most likes,
then we're going to tweet it out

00:00:32.834 --> 00:00:35.400
so that everyone at
home can "wetweet" it.

00:00:35.400 --> 00:00:38.100
-Ah. Nice.
-It's a shared experience.

00:00:38.100 --> 00:00:40.434
Alright. Are you guys ready?

00:00:40.434 --> 00:00:42.100
I think this first one's
got a lot of potential.

